    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22351" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">incĭpisso</span></b>  (also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">incĭpesso</span></b> ),
		ĕre, v. a.
		incipio, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to begin</i> (Plautin.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quid hic homo tantum incipissit facere cum
					tantis minis?</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Capt. 4, 2, 22</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nugas ineptiasque maxumas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 3, 3, 17</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">magnam rem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Mil. 2, 2, 73</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sic rationem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">ib. 82</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">brevem orationem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Capt. 2, 1, 19</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Trin. 4, 2, 42</span></i>.</div>
